%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lines DemoBgf_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 24057f766373758429d9a953275f7374, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 33686114304
    m_Localized: Miss Lillian! How are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863040
    m_Localized: Good afternoon, Master Julian. I see no reason for complaints. What
      brings you here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863041
    m_Localized: Is this, perhaps, about the request you intend to make of me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863042
    m_Localized: "Oh. Bastian\u2019s already told you, then."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863043
    m_Localized: Mister Louissant, chivalrous as all gentlemen should aspire to be,
      did me the courtesy of anticipating the subject of our conversation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863044
    m_Localized: "Listen, Miss Lillian\u2026 I know you have some qualms about Cyrus,
      but I \u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863045
    m_Localized: Your fretting is unnecessary. I shall help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863046
    m_Localized: "No, Miss. Please, he is \u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863047
    m_Localized: "Wait, what did you just say? You\u2019re going to help me?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863048
    m_Localized: Does my kindness surprise you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863049
    m_Localized: I am a faithful worshipper of The Gleam, and evidently, excessively
      merciful as well. You may consider my actions retribution for your hospitality,
      if you wish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863050
    m_Localized: Furthermore, a lady of good faith is expected to partake in acts
      of charity, is she not? Even if the target of said charity is a vagabond, indolent
      person like Cyrus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863051
    m_Localized: Right. What do you need, then?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863052
    m_Localized: Mister Louissant has offered me a handful of raspberries, and I
      always carry some daisy petals with me. I believe that, should you fetch me
      some Squid Ink, I would be able to prepare a concoction strong enough to cure
      any ailments.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863053
    m_Localized: "Great! I\u2019ll come back with the Squid Ink soon!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863054
    m_Localized: 'I shall be waiting. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863055
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m really grateful. I mean it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863056
    m_Localized: 'Do not thank me yet, Master Julian. Do it after I cure your friend. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863057
    m_Localized: "Ink\u2026? And where can I find it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863058
    m_Localized: "Oh my\u2026 Wouldn\u2019t it be fortunate, were we close to a Great
      Squid\u2019s lair at this time and moment?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863059
    m_Localized: '[...]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863060
    m_Localized: "Was\u2026 was that sarcasm\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863061
    m_Localized: "Mister Louissant has been teaching me such \u201Cfigure of speech\u201D.
      It might be considered terribly uncouth for a lady of my station to use it,
      but I cannot deny it has been remarkably useful. \n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863062
    m_Localized: "I see. Are you sure this \u2018concoction\u2019 will be enough?
      I\u2019ve never seen Cyrus in such a bad state before. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863063
    m_Localized: '[...] '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863064
    m_Localized: "No. I shall be direct with you. I have not been informed of the
      man\u2019s symptoms, nor may I be considered a renowned physician. I have cared
      for a few ladies and madams when the town was visited by the plague, but nothing
      beyond that. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863065
    m_Localized: "Oh. Well. You\u2019re the best we\u2019ve got at the moment, miss."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863066
    m_Localized: "In that case, you may inform me of your friend\u2019s condition."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863067
    m_Localized: "Well\u2026 He\u2019s been acting kind of weird for awhile now.
      He\u2019s been more\u2026 more intense, maybe. More reckless."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863068
    m_Localized: "Things got worse yesterday. It looks like he has a fever. He keeps
      tossing around in bed, mumbling gibberish. I\u2019m scared he\u2019s drunk
      or eaten something he shouldn\u2019t have."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863069
    m_Localized: Oh! Are you claiming the sinner has started to act as though he
      is a man possessed? Would that some kind soul had warned this about this possibility,
      huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863070
    m_Localized: "Miss Lillian\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863071
    m_Localized: "Forgive me, forgive me. But I have long since been censored for
      perceiving that man\u2019s hidden perversities! You have to understand my satisfaction
      that the signs I recognized have been brought to light at last. Wouldn\u2019t
      you agree?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863072
    m_Localized: Can you help him or not?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863073
    m_Localized: "Certainly, Master Julian. The concoction shall work. Had you a
      child to care for, there would still be no better medicine to administer. The
      only thing it will not solve is Cyrus\u2019 guilty conscience. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863074
    m_Localized: Even so, I advise you to hide an old boot in his quarters and, if
      you are able to find it, tie a sprig of dried vervain above his doorframe.
      It would be prudent to protect ourselves against demons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33723863075
    m_Localized: Yeah, sure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784566018048
    m_Localized: Julian, darling!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795264
    m_Localized: "Uh\u2026 Hi Bastian. \u2018Everything\u2019s doing\u2019?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795265
    m_Localized: "I mean\u2013 How\u2013 How are you doing?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795266
    m_Localized: "I\u2026 uh\u2026 I meant to say \u201Chow are you doing?\u201D,
      but then my mind went \u201Ceverything good?\u201D. You know how it is."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795267
    m_Localized: Yes. I sure do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795268
    m_Localized: I reckon you've come to ask me to go after your Squid Ink, no?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795269
    m_Localized: "I like to know what I\u2019m getting into, that\u2019s all."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795270
    m_Localized: "Lillian mentioned you\u2019d already talked to her."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795271
    m_Localized: "Right. I\u2026 I think I would\u2019ve appreciated it if you'd
      talked to me first."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795272
    m_Localized: "What for? I\u2019m the one who\u2019s going to fight the monster,
      anyway."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795273
    m_Localized: "Yeah. That\u2019s true. Well..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795274
    m_Localized: '[...]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795275
    m_Localized: "\u2026Do you need anything else?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795282
    m_Localized: "Uh\u2026 Squid Ink?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795283
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m\u2026 I\u2019m not sure I know what you\u2019re talking
      about."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795284
    m_Localized: "You haven\u2019t talked to Lillian today, have you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795285
    m_Localized: Not a problem. Lillian told me she can make Cyrus some medicine.
      She only needs some Squid Ink to do it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795286
    m_Localized: "Or at least that\u2019s what I think she said."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795287
    m_Localized: "Either way, I\u2019m willing to go save our boy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795288
    m_Localized: Oh. Of course. Thank you, then!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795289
    m_Localized: '[...]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795290
    m_Localized: "\u2026Do you need anything else?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795291
    m_Localized: Oh, I only wanted to get to know you a little better, sir.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795292
    m_Localized: "\u2026We\u2019re all in this together, after all. In this \u2018killing
      monsters\u2019, \u2018maybe dying\u2019 thing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795293
    m_Localized: '"Get to know me better", you say?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795294
    m_Localized: "Well, I\u2019m sorry to disappoint you, Julian. There\u2019s not
      much to tell you. I was unfortunately trained by the Merchant Guard, just for
      a while, and then I became a Privateer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795295
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m aware a lot of civilians \u2013 like yourself \u2013 think
      our lives are only adventure, drinking and women. Sometimes it is. But most
      of the time, we just confiscate stolen goods and return it to port."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795296
    m_Localized: "And how exactly did you become a Privateer? Did you always dream
      of hunting pirates or\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795297
    m_Localized: "Hah! No, that wasn\u2019t a dream of mine. Not at all."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795298
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s just how things turned out for me, darling. That\u2019s
      all. I left the Academy and headed straight for the ocean because I couldn\u2019t
      stand being there anymore. Killing pirates was just a plus."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795299
    m_Localized: Oh, but knowing you keep the seas safer must be comforting for you,
      no?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795300
    m_Localized: 'Sure. If you say so. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795301
    m_Localized: "You patrol the seas. You don\u2019t think that\u2019s important?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795302
    m_Localized: Hm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795303
    m_Localized: "Look, darling, don\u2019t get me wrong. I simply don\u2019t hold
      delusions about how \u201Cheroic\u201D or \u201Cmoral\u201D my job truly is."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795304
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m a merc with a permit. I get paid by the Crowns to hunt
      pirate ships, yes, but at the end of the day what I do isn\u2019t so different
      from what they do."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795305
    m_Localized: "I hijack ships, take their belongings, and then I kill or capture
      their captains. I don\u2019t feel bad about it, pirates are scum, and doing
      what I do prevents a lot of suffering. But still, there are a lot of similarities
      between us, don\u2019t you think?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795306
    m_Localized: "Uh\u2026 I think I disagree, Mister Bastian."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795307
    m_Localized: 'You said it yourself: what you do stops these pirates from killing
      and rampaging their way across the seas. You prevent a lot of suffering. That
      must be worth something, at least.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795308
    m_Localized: "It is. It absolutely is. I just\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795309
    m_Localized: "\u2026I\u2019d like to change the subject, darling. This one tires
      me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795310
    m_Localized: Of course! Sure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795311
    m_Localized: I suppose that makes sense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795312
    m_Localized: "Still, we\u2019re lucky you\u2019re on our side, right? Your relic
      looks pretty powerful. It could do some serious damage if it fell on the wrong
      hands!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795313
    m_Localized: '[...]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795314
    m_Localized: "Yes. You\u2019re quite right, darling."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795315
    m_Localized: "I\u2026 yeah\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795316
    m_Localized: Do you have a crew, sir? A ship of your own?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795317
    m_Localized: I work alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795318
    m_Localized: Really? And you can destroy a pirate ship all by yourself?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795319
    m_Localized: "Why? Do you think my skills aren\u2019t up to par? That my fire
      doesn\u2019t burn hot enough?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795320
    m_Localized: "No! That- That\u2019s not it! I- I\u2013"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795321
    m_Localized: "What\u2019s wrong, darling? Cat got your tongue?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795322
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m so sorry! I didn\u2019t\u2026 I didn\u2019t mean to offend
      you, sir, not at all!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795323
    m_Localized: "Hah! Relax, Julian. I\u2019m just messing with you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795324
    m_Localized: "But, yes. I\u2019ve been working freelance lately. And no, I don\u2019t
      intend on elaborating. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795325
    m_Localized: "What was it like being a part of the Merchant Guard? I\u2019ve
      met them a few times back when I was traveling with Cyrus\u2019 family."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795326
    m_Localized: Unpleasant interactions, I imagine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795327
    m_Localized: Quite normal ones, actually.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795328
    m_Localized: "Lucky you. I\u2019ll be forever indebted to The Gleam if I never
      have the displeasure of meeting a guard officer again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795329
    m_Localized: That bad?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795330
    m_Localized: 'It''s an institution filled with brutes. Pack mules, rabid dogs,
      slippery snakes. Incompetent at anything besides beating, threatening and extorting
      people. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795331
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s just say I was glad to be done with them. Even remembering
      I\u2019m somewhat connected to all of it hurts."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795332
    m_Localized: "Wow. I didn\u2019t think it was that bad. Don\u2019t you guys have
      to go through a rigorous training process, or something like that?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795333
    m_Localized: "\u2018You guys\u2019. Leave me out of it, please. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795334
    m_Localized: "Those poor bastards are trained, yes. Like a dog is trained to
      slaughter rabbits. You wouldn\u2019t expect such a beast to sit down and discuss
      the economy with you, would you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795335
    m_Localized: The Merchant Guard recruits the worst of the worst. Rotten failures,
      men bereft of a drop of intelligence, men who are attracted by even the slightest
      measure of power they impose upon others.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795336
    m_Localized: "Their job isn\u2019t to protect people. Of course not. The Mercantile
      Company pays them to protect its assets, and nothing more. They have no need
      for intelligence, nor principles."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795337
    m_Localized: "I\u2019d wager not a single one of them has read Hawke, or gone
      to the theater in the past few months. They\u2019re much more likely to spend
      their days kicking homeless people in the streets, or getting intimately acquainted
      with all the brothels in town.  "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795338
    m_Localized: "Wow. Uh\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795339
    m_Localized: "They haven\u2019t read \u2018Hawke\u2019\u2026? Uh\u2026 That's
      really..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795340
    m_Localized: '[...] '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795341
    m_Localized: "He\u2019s a philosopher. He published a manifesto a few years ago."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795342
    m_Localized: My point is that there is only a handful of guard members who are
      worth knowing. The majority of them is worse than the worst leper, and you
      should keep your distance from them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795343
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ve also been trained by The Guard, haven\u2019t you? So
      they can't be all bad."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795344
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m not one of them. I left as soon as I was able to."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795345
    m_Localized: "Still. I\u2019ve met a few that seemed more\u2026 refined than
      what you\u2019re describing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795346
    m_Localized: "Ugh. Alright. Those were probably raised in Hangmen\u2019s Port,
      like me. They have an Academy over there. One that, at the very least, teaches
      us how to read. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795347
    m_Localized: "Looks like you\u2019ve been through a lot. To hate them that much,
      I mean."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795348
    m_Localized: '[...] '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795349
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s just say that I\u2026 I had some family issues. Related
      to the Guard. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795350
    m_Localized: "Oh\u2026 right. If you ever want to talk about it, I\u2019m here
      for you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795351
    m_Localized: "\u2026\"talk about my feelings\"?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795352
    m_Localized: "A man such as myself is entitled to a few secrets, don\u2019t you
      think, dear? Keeping a sense of mystery is important for one\u2019s image. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2159784582795353
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s not like the Guard itself doesn\u2019t hold some merit,
      either. From the foot soldiers to the admirals, they\u2019re all barbarians. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582912
    m_Localized: 'I want to know what you think of our companions. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582913
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve got strong opinions, as you can imagine. Who would you
      like to talk about?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582914
    m_Localized: "I\u2019d like to talk about someone else now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582915
    m_Localized: Sure. Who would you like to talk about?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582916
    m_Localized: What do you think about Miss Lillian?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582917
    m_Localized: An adorable girl. A sweetheart. A bit naive, perhaps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582918
    m_Localized: "\u2026Miss\u2026Lillian? Are you sure we\u2019re talking about
      the same person?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582919
    m_Localized: "Hm\u2026? Don\u2019t like her?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582920
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s not it. Not exactly. She\u2019s just\u2026 She seems
      a bit difficult to me. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582921
    m_Localized: "We all have our peculiarities, darling. You, for example, seem
      to be scared of our own shadow. It doesn\u2019t mean I should go around criticizing
      you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582922
    m_Localized: "I \u2013 "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582923
    m_Localized: I will not tolerate you speaking to me that way!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582924
    m_Localized: And what do you intend to do about it? Throw me overboard?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582925
    m_Localized: "YOU can\u2019t \u2013 "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582926
    m_Localized: "Hm\u2026? "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582927
    m_Localized: '[...]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582928
    m_Localized: "I think we\u2019d better change the subject, Mister Bastian. For
      the sake of our friendship."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582929
    m_Localized: "A good idea, I\u2019d say."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582930
    m_Localized: '[...] '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582931
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m\u2026I\u2019m sorry. I think I've gone overboard, Mister
      Bastian."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582932
    m_Localized: Oh. Well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582933
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s no problem, darling."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582934
    m_Localized: " I was actually quite impressed, really. I didn\u2019t think you\u2019d
      have the guts to talk back to me. No offense, of course."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582935
    m_Localized: "Uh\u2026 None taken."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582936
    m_Localized: "Anyway: I think we\u2019d better change the subject. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582937
    m_Localized: " I\u2019m\u2026I\u2019m sorry. I don\u2019t dislike her. It\u2019s
      just that\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582938
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t slander her in front of me. She\u2019s younger than
      all of us, and she\u2019s been through much worse than either you or I."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582939
    m_Localized: "Yes. You\u2019re right. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582940
    m_Localized: "Oh. Well. I was a little cruel to you just now, wasn\u2019t I?
      Forgive me. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582941
    m_Localized: "Still, let\u2019s change the subject."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582942
    m_Localized: What else do you know about Miss Lillian?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582943
    m_Localized: "Little more than you do. I know she\u2019s an 'immaculate', and
      that she hails from the northern colonies."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582944
    m_Localized: "Immaculate'\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582945
    m_Localized: "A strange bunch. Those heretics who were banished from the Country
      of Roses. Last century, if I\u2019m not mistaken. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582946
    m_Localized: "I met one of them at Hangmen\u2019s Port once. He was looking for
      someone. I can\u2019t remember all the details."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582947
    m_Localized: "Our girl Lillian, however, seems a lot more agreeable than that
      man. She avoids talking about how she got here, but I\u2019m not interested
      in her secrets."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582948
    m_Localized: 'Got it. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582949
    m_Localized: 'What do you think about Cyrus? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582950
    m_Localized: "Hm. I\u2019m not sure how comfortable I feel, talking about a sick
      person."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582951
    m_Localized: "It\u2019d only be a problem if you were badmouthing him, I think. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582952
    m_Localized: "Do you consider me saying he\u2019s\u2026 peculiar\u2026  as \"badmouthing\"?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582953
    m_Localized: "Uh\u2026 I don\u2019t think so. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582954
    m_Localized: "What exactly do you mean by \u2018peculiar\u2019?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582955
    m_Localized: "He\u2019s a bit odd, don\u2019t you think? He's a sweetheart, or
      so it seems. But I\u2019ve caught him talking to himself a couple of times."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582956
    m_Localized: "And even when he\u2019s not: it\u2019s like he wants let everyone
      know how clever he is. All the time. Makes me want to shake him by the shoulders
      and say \u201CRELAX, darling\", you know what I mean?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582957
    m_Localized: "But he\u2019s a remarkable fighter. I\u2019m glad he\u2019s on
      our side. ."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582958
    m_Localized: How well do you know him?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582959
    m_Localized: "How well do \u2018I\u2019 know him? Darling, didn't you GROW UP
      with him?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582960
    m_Localized: "Well\u2026 yes. But I kind of want to know what he\u2019s told
      you already."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582961
    m_Localized: "Why\u2026? Are you both hiding some big secret?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582962
    m_Localized: "No, it\u2019s just that\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582963
    m_Localized: "Worry not, darling! I won\u2019t pressure you into saying anything!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582964
    m_Localized: "Now, I wouldn\u2019t be opposed if you wanted to tell me some childhood
      stories. The more embarrassing, the better!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582965
    m_Localized: "I\u2019d rather not tell you anything. If that\u2019s okay."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582966
    m_Localized: Ah, but I promise I can keep a secret!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582967
    m_Localized: "Uh\u2026 even then. Sorry."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582968
    m_Localized: Hm. What a pity. I wanted to know if he was always this 'peculiar'.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582969
    m_Localized: "Uh\u2026alright! Let me think\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582970
    m_Localized: A little while after I was found by his family, they paired us together
      and made us share a cabin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582971
    m_Localized: "They had another spare room, which had belonged to his sister before
      she\u2026 Well, I think they didn\u2019t want me to sleep there. So I shared
      a cabin with Cyrus for a while. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582972
    m_Localized: "I must\u2019ve been like twelve and he was\u2026 nine, I think?
      I didn\u2019t say much back then. I hated the fact that even after everything
      that\u2019d happened, I was still stuck in a ship, at sea. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582973
    m_Localized: "And Cyrus really liked reading, especially adventure stories. It
      was strange he even knew how, being only a merchant\u2019s son. But he did,
      and he read every single night."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582974
    m_Localized: "Over time, he started reading out loud. He used to say it was because
      he liked hearing the stories instead of only reading them, but that never made
      sense to me. As far as I\u2019m concerned, he was reading out loud because
      he wanted me to hear them as well."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582975
    m_Localized: He used to go as far as skipping the descriptions of the monsters
      and pirates, because he knew I would get scared!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582976
    m_Localized: Beautiful story. Not embarrassing, like I asked, but cute. Adorable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582977
    m_Localized: " Besides, it\u2019s nice to know he\u2019s always been \u2018peculiar\u2019
      like that."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582978
    m_Localized: 'What do you think about Bertrand? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469324582979
    m_Localized: The man knows how to live the good life!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777216
    m_Localized: A bit timid in his day-today life, but very fun to share a few drinks
      with.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777217
    m_Localized: "I hear he\u2019s a good carpenter, too. An excellent addition to
      our crew. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777218
    m_Localized: "You mentioned his work\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777219
    m_Localized: Has he ever built you something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777220
    m_Localized: "Well, no. That\u2019s why I said \u201CI hear\u201D he\u2019s a
      good carpenter. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777221
    m_Localized: Regardless, I believe any artisan, good or not, is better than none.
      Especially when we're in the middle of the ocean.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777222
    m_Localized: Do you know anything else about him?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777223
    m_Localized: "I know he\u2019s really into rum, and that he\u2019s got a family
      he doesn\u2019t like talking about a lot. I mean, who does, right?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777224
    m_Localized: "On that matter, I think our rum stores are running low. It\u2019d
      be good if we could get some more."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777225
    m_Localized: "Thank you for your time, Mister Bastian! I don\u2019t want to talk
      about anything else for now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777226
    m_Localized: 'Yes, yes. If you want to say anything else, you know where to find
      me, darling. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777227
    m_Localized: "If it\u2019s no problem to you, I\u2019d like to change the subject!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777228
    m_Localized: Not at all. What would you like to discuss, then?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777229
    m_Localized: Back already, darling?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777230
    m_Localized: Hi, Mister Bastian!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777231
    m_Localized: "You just couldn\u2019t keep away, could you? What would you like
      to talk about?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777232
    m_Localized: Good morning, Cyrus! Are you feeling better?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777233
    m_Localized: Oh! Hey, Jules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777234
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m\u2026fine. Well enough to fight for you again! What about
      you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777235
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m doing great! I\u2019m happy you\u2019re cured. I was afraid
      of\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777236
    m_Localized: "I was afraid of something bad happening. Of you never getting back
      to the way you were before. I don\u2019t know."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777237
    m_Localized: "Oh. There was no need to worry. And there\u2019s more, I wasn\u2019t
      even feeling bad. Not exactly."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777238
    m_Localized: "You weren\u2019t\u2026 feeling bad?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777239
    m_Localized: You couldn't leave your bed for almost two days! You were delirious!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777240
    m_Localized: "Technically, I\u2019d only have been delirious if my logical reasoning
      had been affected. And my logical reasoning wasn\u2019t affected. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777241
    m_Localized: "My mind was perfectly sound! I\u2019d dare say it had been months
      since my head was so clear. I already know which experiment I have to run next,
      and what I need to be able to run it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777242
    m_Localized: "\"A sound mind\"? That makes no sense, Cyrus! You were OUT OF IT!
      You were feverish, you couldn\u2019t eat, and you were spouting gibberish!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777243
    m_Localized: "What\u2019s with all this sudden concern, now? I\u2019m fine, aren\u2019t
      I?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777244
    m_Localized: "CYRUS \u2014 "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777245
    m_Localized: "Cyrus, I was worried about you. You were unwell. Visibly unwell.
      You can go ahead and ask anyone here. And you\u2019re still claiming you were
      fine?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777246
    m_Localized: 'Yes, because I WAS. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777247
    m_Localized: "Listen, Julian, I understand that now, suddenly, you want to be
      concerned about me. And okay, maybe I wasn\u2019t physically doing well. But
      mentally? I felt great. Greater than ever, even. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777248
    m_Localized: "Cyrus\u2026 "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777249
    m_Localized: "I don\u2019t want to talk about this anymore. If you want to talk
      about something else, great. Otherwise, I\u2019d rather be left in peace. Alone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777250
    m_Localized: "Well, no. I\u2019m not leaving you alone. You can\u2019t be mad
      at me for caring. That\u2019s unfair. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777251
    m_Localized: "REALLY, Julian? Even after you \u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777252
    m_Localized: '[...] '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777253
    m_Localized: "Fine. You\u2019re right. I was out of it. It won\u2019t happen
      again, if I can help it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777254
    m_Localized: " But if I CAN'T help it, don\u2019t expect me to pretend it won\u2019t
      be an interesting experience. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777255
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m in a region dominated by creatures I can\u2019t even begin
      to wrap my mind around, and suddenly I\u2019m struck by a strange illness that
      seems to sharpen my mind while weakening my body?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777256
    m_Localized: "Honestly, it sounds like a good opportunity to me. I could write
      about it. Take my findings to some university, I don\u2019t know. Can\u2019t
      you see how good this could be for me?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777257
    m_Localized: "I\u2026Uh\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777258
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m still not comfortable with this, Cyrus. I\u2019m going
      to ask Lillian to prepare... something. If you get sick again, I\u2019ll bring
      you back immediately. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777259
    m_Localized: '[...] '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777260
    m_Localized: "Ugh. Fine. If you don\u2019t want to see me happy, do whatever
      you want. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777261
    m_Localized: 'Cyrus! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777262
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m kidding! By the Three-Bodied God\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777263
    m_Localized: "\u2026Alright. I get it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777264
    m_Localized: '[...]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777265
    m_Localized: "\u2026You do?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777266
    m_Localized: " I do. You want to be taken seriously as a scholar. An antiquarian.
      Archivist. I don\u2019t know."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777267
    m_Localized: 'A little bit of each. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777268
    m_Localized: "Right. If getting sick actually helped you to get closer to your
      dreams, it might\u2019ve been worth it. I\u2019ll support you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777269
    m_Localized: "Hah! Great. You\u2019re incredible."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777270
    m_Localized: "If I ever get like that again\u2026 I\u2019d appreciate it if you
      let me be sick for a while. Not for long. A couple of days, or so."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777271
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll \u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777272
    m_Localized: "\u2026I\u2019ll think about it, okay?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777273
    m_Localized: Sure!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777274
    m_Localized: '[...]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777275
    m_Localized: "Sorry. Forgive me, Cyrus. I\u2014 I stuck my nose in your business,
      and I shouldn\u2019t have. I understand that I don\u2019t have the right to
      do that anymore."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777276
    m_Localized: ' But I really worry about you. Truly.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777277
    m_Localized: 'Hm. Alright. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777278
    m_Localized: " I\u2026Uh\u2026I think we\u2019d better change the subject. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777279
    m_Localized: Please.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777280
    m_Localized: "Uh\u2026Okay. Just\u2026 Just be careful, alright?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777281
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m always careful. \"Careful\" is my middle name. And there\u2019s
      more, if it happens again, you can just ask Lillian to give me some more medicine."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777282
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m glad it worked! I was afraid it wouldn\u2019t be enough."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469328777283
    m_Localized: 'Ah, it was enough alright. It was disgusting. It immediately brought
      me back. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971520
    m_Localized: Wait. LILLIAN gave you medicine?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971521
    m_Localized: Yes! A disgusting one, but it woke me up immediately. She told me
      Bastian fetched her some squid ink, or something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971522
    m_Localized: "I didn\u2019t really understand. She seemed scared I was contagious,
      or something. She ordered Bastian to pour that thing down my throat then left
      the room without looking back."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971523
    m_Localized: "Right\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971524
    m_Localized: "The important thing is that you\u2019re cured now! "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971525
    m_Localized: 'Hm. I guess. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971526
    m_Localized: Should we talk about something else?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971527
    m_Localized: " I don\u2019t see why not!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971528
    m_Localized: "I think I don\u2019t want to talk about anything else, Cyrus. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971529
    m_Localized: "Okay! We\u2019ll talk later, then."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971530
    m_Localized: 'How has life been treating you, these past few years? Have you
      been studying a lot of relics? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971531
    m_Localized: "Yes. I\u2019ve done some other stuff, too. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971532
    m_Localized: "Such as\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971533
    m_Localized: "Reading stories. Working as a researcher for the Crowns. That kind
      of thing. I\u2019ve even lived in Brimstone Hill for awhile, but I left after
      the Crimson Crown blockaded the port."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971534
    m_Localized: "Well, technically it wasn\u2019t the Crimson Crown who blockaded
      the port. They paid some privateers to do it. I even asked Bastian if he was
      there, but he said he wasn't."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971535
    m_Localized: "Wait. If you\u2019re not employed by the Crown of Roses anymore,
      who are you working for?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971536
    m_Localized: 'Currently? No one, I think. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971537
    m_Localized: "Actually, I think I might be working for you. You\u2019ve been
      feeding me, which is more than I got for some contracts. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971538
    m_Localized: "Once in a while, I work for the Mercantile Company. I\u2019m a
      freelancer. I usually go into the ruins I\u2019m ordered to go to, under the
      service of whoever pays more."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971539
    m_Localized: And you go into these ruins for.. what? To find relics?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971540
    m_Localized: Pretty much!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971541
    m_Localized: "I do more than that, though. I catalog every relic I find according
      to the Petrus Scale, write down a quick description of it, and when I\u2019m
      done I send everything back to whoever hired me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971542
    m_Localized: "And there\u2019s more! My work with the relics allows me to network
      with some universities. Can you believe that, some time back, I received a
      letter from the Oxs\xF3w\u2019s Academy reliquary department?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971543
    m_Localized: Wait. Seriously?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971544
    m_Localized: Yes! It was addressed to me! To me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971545
    m_Localized: "\u2026They asked me to stop sending theories along with the relic
      descriptions. They claimed it was \u201Cunnecessary, and frankly disrespectful
      towards the academic community.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971546
    m_Localized: Looking at the bright side, at least they know who I am!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971547
    m_Localized: "Have you worked for both Crowns before, then? Isn\u2019t that...
      troublesome? Due to the ongoing conflicts, I mean?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971548
    m_Localized: No. Should it be?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971549
    m_Localized: "Well, I thought it would. Your employers don\u2019t care about
      you switching sides all the time?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971550
    m_Localized: "I don\u2019t know. I never asked. And there\u2019s more, it\u2019s
      not even a real war. It\u2019s just some raiding here and there. The nobles
      of the old continent keep meeting up for tea parties as though nothing is happening."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971551
    m_Localized: "Well, nothing\u2019s happening over there. Everything happens at
      the Shining Seas. You know. Here. Where you work."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971552
    m_Localized: "Oh, but they don\u2019t need to worry about me! I\u2019m in it
      for the relics, not the money. If a client asks me to catalog something for
      them, I\u2019ll do it for them, regardless of how much others might offer me. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971553
    m_Localized: "But what about you? Doesn't it bother you that you\u2019re basically
      contributing to both sides of the war?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971554
    m_Localized: "Hm. No. You know I don\u2019t care much for politics. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971555
    m_Localized: "Well\u2026 I think you should care at least a little, no?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971556
    m_Localized: "I mean, aren\u2019t you kind of\u2026 I don\u2019t know, contributing
      to the continuity of the war?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971557
    m_Localized: Me? Why would I be?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971558
    m_Localized: "Relics can be pretty powerful, right? Like Bastian\u2019s, or yours.
      Isn\u2019t it kind of like selling weapons to both sides?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971559
    m_Localized: What?! Of course not!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971560
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m an antiquarian. A scholar. I only work in cataloging and
      delivering old junk. Really intriguing old junk, and sure, sometimes there\u2019s
      some powerful stuff hidden in there, but still, it\u2019s just old junk."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971561
    m_Localized: "And there\u2019s more, you can\u2019t hold me responsible for what
      the Crowns, the Mercantile Company or some rando down the road might do with
      the relics. It\u2019d be like holding the shipwright accountable for what the
      captain decides to do with the ship."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971562
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m not saying you\u2019re responsible, Cyrus. It\u2019s just
      that these conflicts affect a lot of people\u2019s lives over here. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971563
    m_Localized: "Perhaps you should consider the consequences your work might have
      on other people. It\u2019d be good. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971564
    m_Localized: "Ugh. Let\u2019s agree to disagree. It\u2019s like I said: I\u2019m
      a scholar. I don\u2019t sell weapons. I just explore ruins."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971565
    m_Localized: "I guess you\u2019re right. It\u2019s no use caring so much about
      something you can\u2019t change."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971566
    m_Localized: "Tell me about it! That\u2019s exactly it. If it wasn\u2019t me,
      someone else would do it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971567
    m_Localized: "And there\u2019s more: it could be much worse. I\u2019d never damage
      a relic, but a random thug could go as far as activating one by accident. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971568
    m_Localized: "And that would be a problem\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971569
    m_Localized: 'In most cases, no. Almost all relics do harmless stuff, like shining
      or cooling down. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971570
    m_Localized: "Some of them could trigger explosions, though. Huge explosions,
      like, enormous ones. I\u2019ve heard some relics even house thousand-year-old
      demons just waiting for the time to be set free!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971571
    m_Localized: "I was even wondering if, maybe, the monsters we\u2019ve been stumbling
      unto might\u2019ve come from relics, considering\u2014 "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971572
    m_Localized: Ok! That's enough!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971573
    m_Localized: "I\u2026 uh\u2026 I think we were speaking politics, no?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971574
    m_Localized: "Oh, that\u2019s true. Sorry. It\u2019s like I was saying: at the
      end of the day, I\u2019m just a scholar. I\u2019m not doing anything wrong.
      I\u2019m only exploring ruins. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971575
    m_Localized: And how did you learn to fight, exactly? Last time we saw each other,
      you were kind of flimsy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971576
    m_Localized: 'Like me. No offense. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971577
    m_Localized: "Oh, most of the effort didn\u2019t come from me. I did train with
      some soldiers back when I was working for the Crown of Roses, but most of what
      I do comes from my relic.  "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971578
    m_Localized: " I\u2026 I kind of figured the disembodied hands and weapons were
      magical. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971579
    m_Localized: "But still, the way you move in battle\u2026 You\u2019re not usually
      like that. You\u2019re usually a bit more\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971580
    m_Localized: 'Clumsy? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971581
    m_Localized: 'Not exactly. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971582
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s all due to the relic. It makes me stronger. Faster. Cool,
      right?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971583
    m_Localized: 'I guess so. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971584
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s also a fascinating object of study. I still haven\u2019t
      found any other relic quite like it. Have you noticed it\u2019s red?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971585
    m_Localized: Where did you find such a special relic?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971586
    m_Localized: 'Oh. Well. At a job I did in High Hill. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469332971587
    m_Localized: "I found it in\u2026 Some kind of ancient temple, I think. Left
      behind by the old civilizations."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165824
    m_Localized: "I see. And you just decided to keep it? I mean, you didn\u2019t
      catalog it and send it to your employer?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165825
    m_Localized: "No! They had very\u2026 specific goals for this particular expedition.
      I didn\u2019t need to send them this relic. Only a few others."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165826
    m_Localized: "And I also, uh\u2026 Drew a map of the temple. They wanted me to."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165827
    m_Localized: "\u2026Right. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165828
    m_Localized: ' You still really like relics, huh? I think they were your favorite
      part of the stories we used to read when we were kids.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165829
    m_Localized: "Technically, I\u2019m the one who read them. You were barely literate
      when you joined the family. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165830
    m_Localized: "Hey, that\u2019s not true."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165831
    m_Localized: But you learned! You were a scaredy little cat, but you did learn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165832
    m_Localized: "I wasn\u2019t scared of reading. It\u2019s not my fault you only
      had horror books. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165833
    m_Localized: 'They were adventure books. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165834
    m_Localized: Can we go back to the relics?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165835
    m_Localized: "Absolutely. Did you know that, before the Awakening, the relic
      crystals used to be dull? They weren\u2019t considered good enough even for
      jewelry. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165836
    m_Localized: "To think that, thanks to them, nowadays, you can even fly like
      a bird. It\u2019s incredible, isn\u2019t it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165837
    m_Localized: Wait. Fly like a bird? Your relic allows you to fly?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165838
    m_Localized: Not MY relic. My relic can do other stuff, but not that. I was speaking
      hypothetically.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165839
    m_Localized: 'I wanted to know what you think about our companions. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165840
    m_Localized: "Hm. I think they\u2019re\u2026 normal. Do you want to know about
      anyone in particular?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165841
    m_Localized: What are your thoughts on Miss Lillian?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165842
    m_Localized: About Lillian? I'm not sure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165843
    m_Localized: "We talked the day she got here, but since that day it\u2019s like
      she\u2019s always busy with something. Or that\u2019s how it is whenever I
      get near her."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165844
    m_Localized: "And the way she talks is weird. I don\u2019t know if it\u2019s
      because of her religion, or... "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165845
    m_Localized: She was also the one who made that disgusting black water that brought
      me back. It tasted awful, but I guess she had good intentions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165846
    m_Localized: "Uh\u2026I think she doesn\u2019t like you very much. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165847
    m_Localized: Wait, what?! Lillian?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165848
    m_Localized: "Yeah. It\u2019s\u2026 a hunch."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165849
    m_Localized: "But\u2026 but why? Did I do something wrong?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165850
    m_Localized: "I think she doesn\u2019t like your behavior. I heard she \u201Csenses
      something bad\u201D in you. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165851
    m_Localized: "I\u2026 Why are you telling me this?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165852
    m_Localized: "I just don\u2019t want you getting hurt. I know you\u2026 I know
      you\u2019ve been let down a couple times. In the past, I mean. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165853
    m_Localized: "Oh\u2026 Right. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165854
    m_Localized: "Well, it\u2019s not like I wanted to be close to her, or anything.
      She\u2019s too religious for me. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165855
    m_Localized: " \u2026Thank you. For the head\u2019s up."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165856
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m sorry."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165857
    m_Localized: "We\u2019ve already had a lot of problems. I\u2026 I don\u2019t
      want infighting amongst the crew, so I thought it might be best to warn you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165858
    m_Localized: "Hm\u2026 I see."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165859
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll keep my distance. I don\u2019t want any trouble, and
      I\u2019m for sure not eager to get into a fight against a crazy cultist. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165860
    m_Localized: "We won\u2019t speak ever again if it\u2019s up to me. Not even
      once."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165861
    m_Localized: Right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165862
    m_Localized: "I\u2026uh\u2026 I don\u2019t know. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165863
    m_Localized: "You don\u2019t know?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165864
    m_Localized: I thought you should know, I guess.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165865
    m_Localized: "I\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165866
    m_Localized: Ok. Thanks for telling me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165867
    m_Localized: What do you think about Bastian?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165868
    m_Localized: Nice guy. We talked about how the Petrus Scale is an inefficient
      method for classifying relics a few days ago.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165869
    m_Localized: Is Bastian a relic aficionado as well?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165870
    m_Localized: "Well\u2026 He kind of just stood there. And shook his head."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165871
    m_Localized: "But at least he didn\u2019t cut me off. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165872
    m_Localized: Do you know anything else about him?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165873
    m_Localized: 'He told me he works as a Privateer! Like the ones in the stories. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165874
    m_Localized: "Did you know he\u2019s able to use his relic to burn the sails
      of enemy ships from a distance? He told me he can shoot up to a kilometer away!
      They can\u2019t escape, then."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165875
    m_Localized: "I was wondering more about things like \u201Cwhere did he come
      from\u201D or \u201Cwhat brought him to the Sea of Serpents\u201D."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165876
    m_Localized: "Oh. I didn\u2019t ask him about that."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165877
    m_Localized: What do you think about Bertrand?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165878
    m_Localized: "He\u2019s really moody. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165879
    m_Localized: "But a nice guy, other than that. We don\u2019t talk a lot."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165880
    m_Localized: Do you know anything else about him?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165881
    m_Localized: "Hm\u2026 He\u2019s a carpenter, right?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165882
    m_Localized: I like artisans. It was because of men like Bertrand that the first
      relics were made thousands of years ago.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165883
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m pretty sure they didn\u2019t work with wood, though. Every
      relic I\u2019ve ever seen had metal casings. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165884
    m_Localized: I want to talk about somebody else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165885
    m_Localized: About whom?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165886
    m_Localized: "Hey! You\u2019re back?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165887
    m_Localized: I wanted to talk some more, if you have the time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165888
    m_Localized: I always have time for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165889
    m_Localized: 'Master Julian! You have returned. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165890
    m_Localized: I have. Hi, Miss Lillian!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165891
    m_Localized: As you can probably observe, I am not yet in possession of the last
      ingredient necessary to prepare the concoction your companion so desperately
      needs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165892
    m_Localized: 'Ah. Yes. I can see that. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165893
    m_Localized: 'I beg of thee, then, my good sir: say what you need of me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165894
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve got the Squid Ink already! "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165895
    m_Localized: Exquisite! You should be pleased to know I will start preparing
      the concoction at once! You need only hand me the ingredient.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165896
    m_Localized: '[...]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165897
    m_Localized: "\u2026? "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469337165898
    m_Localized: 'Well? Speak! Where is the Ink? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360128
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s\u2014 I don\u2019t have it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360129
    m_Localized: Is there a thieve amongst us?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360130
    m_Localized: ' I never had it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360131
    m_Localized: "I- I don\u2019t know what came over me. The words just\u2026 spilled
      out. I\u2019m sorry."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360132
    m_Localized: 'Hm. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360133
    m_Localized: What is the purpose of our conversation, Master Julian?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360134
    m_Localized: "I wanted to understand your background better. Bastian told me
      you are an \u201CImmaculate\u201D\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360135
    m_Localized: '[...]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360136
    m_Localized: 'I would not refer to myself as such, would that I could. No, If
      I dared, I would get nothing in return besides sinking myself deeper into sin. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360137
    m_Localized: "Uhm\u2026 We don\u2019t need to talk about it. If it\u2019s a delicate
      subject, I mean."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360138
    m_Localized: "We may speak. I was, for a long period of time, part of the group
      your people call \u201CThe Immaculate\u201D. I hail from a northern colony
      by birth, but I can not claim those lands as my home anymore."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360139
    m_Localized: No. I believe I belong to the oceans now. Like yourself. I shroud
      myself within the waves to hide my dishonor, incapable of even returning to
      beg for forgiveness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360140
    m_Localized: " I, uh, I\u2019m not so sure I\u2019d say I \"belong to the oceans\". "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360141
    m_Localized: I believe I overstepped the limits of divine mercy, Master Julian.
      My regrets may only find earthly redemption. Therefore, it is what I seek.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360142
    m_Localized: "I\u2026 I wish to speak of other matters, now. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360143
    m_Localized: "I\u2019d like to understand your background a little better. Did
      you come from a northern colony? "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360144
    m_Localized: 'Hm. I feel as though, for the sake of my soul, we must not relive
      the past. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360145
    m_Localized: "For\u2026 for the sake of your soul\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360146
    m_Localized: 'Under the risk of bringing hypocrisy into the fold of my sins:
      do not ask me about my past again. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360147
    m_Localized: 'Uh... Okay, then. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360148
    m_Localized: Why wouldn't you call yourself 'Immaculate'?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360149
    m_Localized: There is no man or woman in the northern colonies who would dare
      refer to themselves by such name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360150
    m_Localized: Because...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360151
    m_Localized: It would be heresy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360152
    m_Localized: 'Immaculate'' is a vulgar word, used by the souls of these here
      lands against the will of the northern folk. It means, in foul language, something
      free of sin. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360153
    m_Localized: 'Now, show me greater insolence than to consider oneself devoid
      of sin? And insolence is, by nature, sinful. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360154
    m_Localized: Good folk who fear and respect the Gleam would never hold such claims.
      Not willingly. I assure you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360155
    m_Localized: ...Right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360156
    m_Localized: "I think I don\u2019t want to talk about anything else, Miss Lillian. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360157
    m_Localized: Yes. Leave me be, then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360158
    m_Localized: 'Hm. Can we talk about something else? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360159
    m_Localized: Certainly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360160
    m_Localized: Master Julian! Did you notice anything different in this here room?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360161
    m_Localized: Hi Miss Lillian! Uh... Cyrus is back?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360162
    m_Localized: The loafer is back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360163
    m_Localized: 'Hm. Yes. Thank you for that. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360164
    m_Localized: Think nothing of it. My hope is that, once we reach land, the art
      of herbalism shall be enough for me to earn the daily bread. Helping your companion
      was a fine way of honing the craft.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360165
    m_Localized: 'Well, you''ve certainly worked fast. I''d barely noticed Bastian
      had brought the Ink, and Cyrus was already back again.  '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360166
    m_Localized: Modesty is a virtue. I will therefore not emphasize the delicacy
      and celerity of my skills.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360167
    m_Localized: 'Sure. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360168
    m_Localized: Miss Lillian! How are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5012469341360169
    m_Localized: Good tidings, Master Julian.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
